cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "bdd2pw: Live-DOM Page Object Scaffolding from Gherkin Specifications via the Microsoft Playwright MCP"
abstract: >
  bdd2pw is an open-source Node.js test-generation tool that produces
  compiling Playwright TypeScript test suites from Gherkin behaviour
  specifications via live-DOM page object scaffolding using the
  Microsoft Playwright MCP. Validated on 7 domain packs with API rule
  enforcement, JSON scenarios, merge-mode authoring, hook fixtures,
  and LLM batching diagnostics.
